{"type":"Film","id":"FR2016_108","slug":"fr2016-108-cosmodrama","title":{"native":"Cosmodrama","english":"Cosmodrama"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-06-29","year":2016},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Philippe Fernandez","slug":"philippe-fernandez","name":"Philippe Fernandez","birthYear":1958,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Science Fiction"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/19/117/161043/format_page/cosmodrama.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x4httqz"},"synopsis":{"native":"Un vaisseau spatial lancé dans l’univers. Sept membres d’équipage se réveillent malencontreusement de cryogénisation. Sans doute trop longue, celle-ci les a rendu amnésiques : ils ne savent ni où ils sont, ni d’où ils viennent, ni où ils vont. L'un d'entre eux, le plus dépressif, le vivra comme un vrai chemin de croix.","english":"A space-ship is lost in space, conveying a small team of scientists who no longer know, probably due to too long a cryogenisation period, where they are, where they're going, or where they've come from. One of them, the most depressed, will live this moment as a huge hardship."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Bernard Blancan","slug":"bernard-blancan","name":"Bernard Blancan","birthYear":1958,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Emmanuel Moynot","slug":"emmanuel-moynot","name":"Emmanuel Moynot","birthYear":1960,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Jackie Berroyer","slug":"jackie-berroyer","name":"Jackie Berroyer","birthYear":1946,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Philippe Fernandez","slug":"philippe-fernand